## Code Example

```javascript
// Example: region-based feature flag with circuit breaker
const featureEnabled = getFlag('ETA_NOTIF');
const breaker = new CircuitBreaker(fetchEtaUpdate, { timeout: 2000, errorThreshold: 0.5 });

if (featureEnabled) {
  breaker.run().then(processEta).catch(handleFallback);
} else {
  processEtaFallback();
}
```

